-- =============================================================================
-- Generated by scripts/gen-pocheon-departure-days-sql-2026-08.mjs
--
-- SQL 05/06 were applied from the version on main at the time, which predates
-- the departure-day work. Measured afterwards: available_days_signature was
-- NULL and the departure-days accordion item absent in all 10 locales, so a
-- guest could still pick any date and only hit the constraint at checkout.
--
